# Store and check out LF everywhere. The shell scripts, Dockerfiles and compose
# files run on Linux, where a CRLF shebang breaks them; Windows tooling copes with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
